==Battleground==
*6 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4.67~8 seconds<sup>140f~240f</sup>.
*4 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 4.67~8 seconds<sup>140f~240f</sup>.
*5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 143.33 seconds<sup>4,300f</sup>, delay 4.67~8 seconds<sup>140f~240f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zamelle]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If one wishes to, the peon support is limited and can be exhausted before hitting the base. A meatshield and Holy Blast are recommended here. If you are worried about Zapy, a weaker anti-Zombie Uber can make this stage a cakewalk.

